# Community Pantry Stock List — Prompt & Scope

## Problem
Neighborhood community pantries need a simple way for volunteers to check remaining stock and update quantities during distribution without losing paper tallies.

## Core Feature (FR-01)
- Add pantry stock items (name, category, quantity) to `localStorage`
- Adjust item quantities with `-` and `+` (clamped at `0`) and delete items
- View total units, low/out-of-stock counts (`<= 5`), and filter by category
- Keep the build to one HTML file with no backend, logins, or database
